     *   `MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_EMBEDDING`, `MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_VIDEO`. -
     *   MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_UNSPECIFIED: No use-case filter applied; return all models. -
